   "stem_html": "Released acetylcholine is inactivated by ________; available choline is ________ while acetate is ________.",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 918408,
     "content_html": "monoamine oxidase / allowed to passively diffuse away / removed from the synapse by reuptake"
    },
